CVE-2024-52308

# CVE-2025-15558 - Docker CLI plugin search path privilege escalation (NOT APPLICABLE)
# Windows-only (CWE-427). github.com/docker/cli is a transitive Go library in gh CLI,
# not a standalone Docker install. Vulnerable code path unreachable on Linux.
# Resolves when: gh CLI bumps docker/cli to v29.2.0+
# Review: 2026-03-19
CVE-2025-15558

# CVE-2026-22817, CVE-2026-22818 - Hono JWT algorithm confusion (NOT APPLICABLE)
# hono@4.11.3 transitive dep via Claude Code/Gemini CLI in base image.
# No web server, no JWT processing, no HTTP endpoints - CLI tools only.
# Resolves when: base image updates to hono@4.11.4+
# Review: weekly
CVE-2026-22817
CVE-2026-22818

